FYI

Yes we use them all the time
Both SCSI terminator jumpers must be installed (next to the internal 68pin 
connector)
Also - if this is not the HP labelled one it will be problematic as the 
firmware for the HP variant was quite different
(we went through about 50 pieces before we discovered all this - and it cost 
us a pretty penny having to shlef the Adaptec originals)

